 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Name extracted declarations.** Clients can supply a name for an extracted variable, constant, function or method before reviewing the proposal. Conflicting or invalid names are refused, and omitted names retain automatic naming. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Extraction preserves the surrounding program.** Moving statements retains multiline string values, static class context and unselected statements or comments on shared lines. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Extraction uses current dependency types.** Resolving a proposal observes accepted unsaved dependency changes and Undo before inferring its signature. Extraction also preserves CRLF layout and refuses unavailable names without silently choosing a different declaration. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Code actions prepare pending inherited source.** The first request in an unchanged child sees an unsaved parent signature edit or undo before background diagnostics finish.
 
